## Stage 1: read-only build and exposure assessment

Collect and assess, where observable:

- hostname, IP addresses, routes, DNS, OS and kernel/build version;
- installed software, package versions, services, processes and loaded DLLs/modules;
- local users, groups, privileges, domain membership, AD/DNS/Kerberos state;
- local and remote ACL behavior, host firewall rules, listening services and egress;
- endpoint protection/EDR products, relevant services/processes/policies and their
